---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '@/data/site.config';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Burrow and Butter collects, uses, and protects your information."
>
  <article class="py-12">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <h1 class="text-bark-900 mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <p class="text-bark-500">Last updated: November 2024</p>

        <p>
          At {siteConfig.name}, we take your privacy seriously. This policy explains what
          information we collect, how we use it, and your rights regarding that information.
        </p>

        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>

        <h3>Information You Provide</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Email address:</strong> When you subscribe to our newsletter, we collect
            your email address. This is used solely to send you our newsletter and any
            digital products you purchase.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Contact information:</strong> If you contact us via email, we retain
            that correspondence.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Automatically Collected Information</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Analytics:</strong> We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors
            use our site. This includes pages visited, time on site, and general location
            (country/city level). This data is anonymized and cannot identify you personally.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Cookies:</strong> We use essential cookies for site functionality and
            analytics cookies to improve our content. You can disable cookies in your browser settings.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To send you our newsletter (if you subscribed)</li>
          <li>To deliver digital products you purchase</li>
          <li>To respond to your inquiries</li>
          <li>To improve our website and content</li>
          <li>To understand our audience and create better content</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>We use the following third-party services:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Kit (ConvertKit):</strong> For newsletter management.
            <a href="https://kit.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Their privacy policy</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Google Analytics:</strong> For website analytics.
            <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Their privacy policy</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Cloudflare:</strong> For website hosting and security.
            <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Their privacy policy</a>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Access the personal data we hold about you</li>
          <li>Request correction of inaccurate data</li>
          <li>Request deletion of your data</li>
          <li>Unsubscribe from our newsletter at any time (link in every email)</li>
          <li>Opt out of analytics tracking using browser settings or extensions</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Data Retention</h2>
        <p>
          We retain your email address as long as you remain subscribed to our newsletter.
          If you unsubscribe, we remove your email within 30 days. Analytics data is
          retained for 26 months.
        </p>

        <h2>Security</h2>
        <p>
          We use industry-standard security measures to protect your data. Our website
          is served over HTTPS, and our email provider uses encryption for data at rest
          and in transit.
        </p>

        <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          Our site is not intended for children under 13. We do not knowingly collect
          information from children under 13.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy from time to time. We'll notify newsletter subscribers
          of significant changes.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this policy? Email us at{' '}
          <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.social.email}`}>{siteConfig.social.email}</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
